  "version": "0.9.23",
  "notes": "Screenshot-only task routing and image evidence reliability: do not let negative 'do not inspect code' instructions trigger Developer Mode; block unrelated web/code tools and optional reviewers for image-only requests; require actual opt-in PC vision observations for every attachment rather than assuming vision status means it ran; retry off-topic code/website answers once, then disclose failure. Improve left-sidebar versus film-poster focus guidance. Normalize Windows short-path attachment aliases. No new model downloads or edits/builds/ADB/Git permissions; XemTV Builds 114 and unfinished 115 untouched; preserves XemAi chats, memories, settings and worker pairing.",
